[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4536434848","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119720#issuecomment-4536434848","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119720","id":4536434848,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDmSAoA","user":{"login":"tateorrtot","id":86398489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2Mzk4NDg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86398489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot","html_url":"https://github.com/tateorrtot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tateorrtot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T18:41:52Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T18:41:52Z","body":"1. Unintentional at first but after looking into the GPUParticles logic, the behaviour of emitting should also be effected by speed_scale. If I didn't change the behaviour of emitting, then we'd get \"emitting = false\" while the particles are still emitting. I did some testing to show this is necessary:\r\n\r\nThis is with the behaviour of emitting being changed by speed_scale\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a255e526-b0d2-43d1-a1d7-35268f84cc5f\r\n\r\nThis is without it if I just fix the signal emitting bug\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d57d4988-7690-483e-934f-66695aed3190\r\n\r\nSo yes it is intentional\r\n\r\nI also changed it so that NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS keeps adding up raw delta time but we check aganist the speed_scale. This is so that \"time\" stays true to the actual raw delta time which makes more sense.\r\n\r\n2. Done, I updated GPUParticles3D to match","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4536434848/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744723240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119720#issuecomment-4744723240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119720","id":4744723240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGs67KA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T17:55:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T16:51:16Z","body":"Could you squash your commits? See our [pull request guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/organization/pull_requests/creating_p